{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1230773-new-scales-for-old-coils","id":1230773,"title":"New Scales,, For old Coils.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-28T05:43:41-07:00","id":1230773,"title":"New Scales,, For old Coils.","content":"seen several ideas for new scales but relatively little ideas for new scales for current Coils<br /> <br /> <br /> Will Start off with One<br /> <br /> A Scale of Coil of the Voivode which lets you embrace a childe of a different clan then yourself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T07:13:52-07:00","id":1230807,"title":"","content":"That would probably be because scales do not require a specific coil (or even covenant status) to learn them. You just get an XP break if you know the pre-selected coil.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T07:42:14-07:00","id":1230812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1230773-new-scales-for-old-coils#post1230773\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">seen several ideas for new scales but relatively little ideas for new scales for current Coils<br /> <br /> <br /> Will Start off with One<br /> <br /> A Scale of Coil of the Voivode which lets you embrace a childe of a different clan then yourself.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like this idea. Care to flesh out the concept with a bit of description and mechanics?<br /> <br /> I'll post again when I get home from work and have a coil idea to share... It'll probably do with Revenants.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Thinning the Blood</span><br /> <b>Prerequisite Coils:</b>l: Voivode (Vast Dynasty)<br /> <b>Procedure: </b>The Dragon takes a volume animal blood mixed with trace barely lethal amounts of various alchemical solutions associate with particular ancient embalming practices equal the volume of blood the mortal subject would normally have and using a modified dialysis machine, which is inscribed with Hermetic symbols of transformation and also Mesoamerican glyphs warding versus evil creatures of the night (The device can be made from scratch or modified from a normal dialysis machine via the Equipment Building Rule CofD Pg. 100, rolling Intelligence+Crafts if done under pressure, but then must also be subject to Binding of a small Area CofD Pg 140), that slowly replaces the the subject's human blood. As the transfer nears completion and the subject starts to die from shock as the body rejects the blood and poison, the Dragon's own Vitae is freshly and willfully drawn via tube into the machine filling the human with this blasphemous concoction but is diluted, which is successfully timed via a Wits + Medicine Roll.<br /> <b>Outcome: </b>If the above procedure is successful at every step the mortal dies and rises as a Revenant with the Dragon as their Sire on the third night after their death, they retain their Blood Sympathies with their creator as normal except the Blood Sympathy is enhanced so that being uplifted to another Clan through Diablerie or intervention by Surrogate Sire (<i>As per VtR 2E Pg. 94</i>) does not remove the Blood Sympathy at the heightened Revenant levels (+5 instead of the mere +3). This ensures a stronger bond to the Dragon than any potential Surrogate Sires. Successfully using this Scale is a Breaking Point for Dragons of Humanity 4 or higher, regardless of whether the Dragon has Vast Dynasty Voivode Coil or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 06-29-2018, 02:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T08:01:08-07:00","id":1230817,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pale_Crusader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1230773-new-scales-for-old-coils?p=1230812#post1230812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I like this idea. Care to flesh out the concept with a bit of description and mechanics?<br /> <br /> I'll post again when I get home from work and have a coil idea to share... It'll probably do with Revenants.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Hmmn something to do with the symbology of the clan chosen such as Crown for Ventrue.<br /> <br /> Roses for Daeva horrific imagery for Nosferatu Shadow's or Maybe Magnifying glasses and book's for Mekhet?<br /> <br /> Or maybe you need a sample of their vitae preserved somehow. ?<br /> <br /> Thing is, most cases where youd want to do this are if theirs no other representation of the clan in your town. or if your a cannibalistic elder that is feeding off of them and wants more variety to his Diet (Or the court to heve Mekhet Seer's Daeve Courtiers, Nosferatu Spies, Ventrue Noble's, and Gangrel Warrior's)<br /> <br /> Customarily, Such Childer are abandoned, with a gift Signifying the clan they've been embraced to.<br /> <br /> Thing is I think &quot;Lock Picks&quot; for Mekhet and Nosferatu, Crown Scepter, or Cash. for Ventrue, should have something different for Nosferatu and Mekhet.<br /> <br /> and Daeva and Gangrel....<br /> <br /> Ideas?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 06-28-2018, 01:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"th