 embraced. However, they are immune to the curse of their sire. So, instead, the curse of their regnant's clan will fill the vacuum. So, a vampire of any clan can sire, and share sympathy with, a vampire of any other clan. <br /> <br /> Possible side effects: A vampire sired in this way will have difficulty siring future generations. Maybe they will be dependent on the scale used to help create them. Maybe they are just plain sterile. maybe they can only create revenants. Maybe this problem will go away on it's own as their blood potency rises. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There Are Four Lights!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/92949-baltimore-the-kiddie-pool-saga-pics-maps-and-links\" target=\"_blank\">[Actual Play] Baltimore: The Kiddie Pool Saga</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/64-figurehead","name":"figurehead","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar64_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"203"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T10:35:06-07:00","id":1230857,"title":"","content":"Only problem with that idea is, it doesnt work if the clan has a paucity of existence in your city.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=